# ============================================
# C语言教学代码仓库 .gitignore
# 覆盖 Visual Studio / VS Code / Clang / GCC
# ============================================

# --- 二进制可执行文件与调试符号 ---
[Bb]in/
[Bb]uild/
*.exe
*.out
*.app
*.dSYM/
*.dSYM

# --- 编译对象与静态/动态库 ---
*.o
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.exp
*.lib
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# --- Visual Studio 构建产物与缓存 ---
.vs/
Debug/
Release/
x64/
x86/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.pch
*.ipch
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.res
*.manifest
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.suo
*.user

# --- 操作系统临时文件 ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.log

# ============================================
# 允许跟踪的教学核心代码与工程资产：
# *.c             — C 语言源文件
# *.h             — C 语言头文件
# *.md            — 教学文档与说明
# *.sh            — 辅助脚本
# ============================================
